# Boiling Rock Rioter {2}{B} (3/3): "Tap an untapped Ally you control: Exile target card from a graveyard" and "Whenever this creature attacks, you
# may cast an Ally spell from among cards you own exiled with this creature". Turn 1 Bot1 casts the Rioter and an Earth Kingdom Protectors. Turn 3
# it casts Gran-Gran (an Ally, summoning sick, but tapping it is a cost, not its {T}: CR 302.6) and Lightning Bolts its own Protectors, then taps
# Gran-Gran to exile the Bolt from its graveyard. The Rioter attacks: firebending 1 adds {R}, and its trigger finds only the Bolt exiled with it, which is
# not an Ally spell, so nothing is asked. Turn 5 Gran-Gran taps again to exile the Protectors; the attack offers it and Bot1 casts it from exile for {W}.
# Bot2 takes 3 from each attack.

